{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few know this, but the ones who sent the meteor to destroy the dinosaurs were aliens from the planet Ctchullus! And there was resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does justice to the history of the dinosaurs, showing how the fight against extinction really happened!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose the order of everything that appears on the screen! Requires strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied weapons with different types of fire and damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different dinosaurs with unique playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of items and weapons to choose from (flamethrowers, SMGs, rocket launchers, or sticks and stones).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item shop to purchase relics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random scenarios, different with each wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP by killing aliens to level up and improve your stats.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005290?t=1758196842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005290/3d97087f550625f7b59a23f3d212e5dbc934a041/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758196842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005290/847ad7cc4fc636afadf2a05bde302a14008d499c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758196842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005290/847ad7cc4fc636afadf2a05bde302a14008d499c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758196842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Few know this, but the ones who sent the meteor to destroy the dinosaurs were aliens from the planet Ctchullus! And there was resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does justice to the history of the dinosaurs, showing how the fight against extinction really happened!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose the order of everything that appears on the screen! Requires strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied weapons with different types of fire and damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different dinosaurs with unique playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of items and weapons to choose from (flamethrowers, SMGs, rocket launchers, or sticks and stones).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item shop to purchase relics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random scenarios, different with each wave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn XP by killing aliens to level up and improve your stats.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Enchant Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005290/702080dcc8fb6ba1e3309f9d62c7334843df1b1f/header.jpg?t=1758196842","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"all rights reserved to Enchant Games","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Before The Extinction","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista/7/8Windows XP/Vista/7/8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card supporting DirectX 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Enchant Games"],"rating